  ('jee-chemistry-haloalkanes-haloarenes-m01', 'jee-chemistry-haloalkanes-haloarenes', 'Haloalkanes & Haloarenes', '**Haloalkanes and haloarenes** have halogens bonded to sp3 carbon and aromatic rings respectively.

