  ('jee-chemistry-alcohols-phenols-ethers-m01', 'jee-chemistry-alcohols-phenols-ethers', 'Alcohols, Phenols & Ethers', '**Alcohols (R-OH)**, **phenols (Ar-OH)** and **ethers (R-O-R'')** share an oxygen functional group but differ widely in reactivity.

