## Key Identities
```
arcsin(x) + arccos(x) = pi/2
arctan(x) + arccot(x) = pi/2
arcsec(x) + arccsc(x) = pi/2
```

## Sum Formula
```
arctan(x) + arctan(y) = arctan((x + y)/(1 - x*y)),  if x*y < 1
```

When x*y > 1 a correction of pi (or -pi) is added depending on signs.

## Useful Conversions
```
