## Derivatives
- The derivative measures instantaneous rate of change: **f''(x) = lim (f(x+h) - f(x))/h**.
- **Maxima/minima:** set f''(x) = 0; if f''''(x) > 0 it is a minimum, if f''''(x) < 0 a maximum.

| Function | Derivative |
| --- | --- |
