  ('gate-engineering-mathematics-sets-relations-m01', 'gate-engineering-mathematics-sets-relations', 'Discrete Mathematics: Sets & Relations', '**Sets and relations** underpin databases, logic and automata — a high-yield discrete mathematics area for GATE CS.

