  ('gate-programming-ds-c-programming-pointers-m01', 'gate-programming-ds-c-programming-pointers', 'C Programming & Pointers', '**Pointers** are the heart of C and a frequent GATE code-tracing topic, covering memory, arrays and dynamic allocation.

## Pointer Basics
- A **pointer** stores a memory address; **&x** takes an address and ***p** dereferences it.
