  ('gate-discrete-math-propositional-predicate-logic-m01', 'gate-discrete-math-propositional-predicate-logic', 'Propositional & Predicate Logic', '**Logic** formalizes reasoning with propositions and quantifiers — a dependable GATE discrete-mathematics scorer.

## Connectives
| Connective | Symbol meaning |
| --- | --- |
