  ('gate-discrete-math-counting-recurrences-m01', 'gate-discrete-math-counting-recurrences', 'Counting & Recurrences', '**Counting** and **recurrence relations** quantify arrangements and recursive growth — a fast-scoring GATE combinatorics topic.

