  ('gate-computer-organization-addressing-modes-instruction-formats-m01', 'gate-computer-organization-addressing-modes-instruction-formats', 'Addressing Modes & Instruction Formats', 'An **instruction** has an **opcode** (operation) and zero or more **operands**. **Addressing modes** specify how an operand''s location is determined.

## Common addressing modes
| Mode | Operand is… |
