  ('jee-mathematics-heights-distances-q08', 'jee-mathematics-heights-distances', 'Observing a top from two points gives two equations mainly to eliminate the:', 'Height', 'Unknown distance', 'Angle', 'Time', 'B', 'Two observations let you eliminate the unknown base distance and solve for height.', 7),
