  ('jee-adv-chem-hydrocarbons-q09', 'jee-adv-chem-hydrocarbons', 'Ozonolysis of an alkene followed by workup gives:', 'Aldehydes and/or ketones', 'Alcohols only', 'Alkanes', 'Aromatic acids', 'A', 'Ozonolysis cleaves C=C to carbonyl compounds, revealing the double-bond position.', 8),
