  ('jee-adv-chem-d-f-block-q07', 'jee-adv-chem-d-f-block', 'Zn, Cd, and Hg are not typical transition metals because their d-orbitals are:', 'Completely filled (d¹⁰)', 'Empty', 'Half-filled', 'Absent', 'A', 'With full d¹⁰ configurations they lack partially filled d-orbitals in common states.', 6),
