  ('jee-adv-chem-d-f-block-q10', 'jee-adv-chem-d-f-block', 'Transition metals form alloys readily because their atoms have:', 'Similar atomic sizes', 'Very different sizes', 'No metallic character', 'Full outer shells', 'A', 'Similar radii allow substitution in lattices, forming alloys.', 9),
