  ('jee-adv-chem-d-f-block-q12', 'jee-adv-chem-d-f-block', 'The lanthanoid contraction makes the sizes of 4d and 5d elements:', 'Very similar (e.g., Zr and Hf)', 'Very different', 'Zero', 'Infinite', 'A', 'The contraction makes pairs like Zr/Hf nearly identical in size.', 11),
