  ('jee-adv-chem-alcohols-phenols-ethers-q07', 'jee-adv-chem-alcohols-phenols-ethers', 'An electron-withdrawing group on phenol (e.g., −NO₂) makes it:', 'More acidic', 'Less acidic', 'Neutral', 'Basic', 'A', 'Electron-withdrawing groups stabilise the phenoxide, increasing acidity.', 6),
