  ('jee-adv-chem-alcohols-phenols-ethers-q12', 'jee-adv-chem-alcohols-phenols-ethers', 'Phenol reacts with bromine water to give:', '2,4,6-tribromophenol (white ppt)', 'Bromobenzene', 'No reaction', 'Aniline', 'A', 'The activated ring gives 2,4,6-tribromophenol readily with bromine water.', 11),
