  ('jee-adv-math-quadratic-equations-q10', 'jee-adv-math-quadratic-equations', 'Irrational roots of a rational-coefficient quadratic occur:', 'In conjugate pairs (p ± √q)', 'Singly', 'As equal roots', 'Never', 'A', 'Irrational roots come as conjugate surds p ± √q.', 9),
