  ('jee-adv-math-quadratic-equations-q12', 'jee-adv-math-quadratic-equations', 'For a cubic ax³ + bx² + cx + d = 0, the sum of the roots is:', '−b/a', '−c/a', '−d/a', 'b/a', 'A', 'By Vieta''s formulas, the sum of the roots of a cubic is −b/a.', 11),
