  ('jee-adv-math-coordinate-geometry-q03b', 'jee-adv-math-coordinate-geometry', 'The distance from point (x₀,y₀) to line ax + by + c = 0 is:', '|ax₀+by₀+c|/√(a²+b²)', 'ax₀+by₀+c', '√(a²+b²)', '|x₀+y₀|', 'A', 'The perpendicular distance formula divides by √(a²+b²).', 3),
