  ('jee-adv-math-coordinate-geometry-q06', 'jee-adv-math-coordinate-geometry', 'For x² + y² + 2gx + 2fy + c = 0, the centre is:', '(−g, −f)', '(g, f)', '(−f, −g)', '(g, −f)', 'A', 'The centre is (−g, −f) and radius √(g²+f²−c).', 5),
