  ('jee-adv-math-coordinate-geometry-q10', 'jee-adv-math-coordinate-geometry', 'The midpoint of the segment joining (x₁,y₁) and (x₂,y₂) is:', '((x₁+x₂)/2, (y₁+y₂)/2)', '(x₁+x₂, y₁+y₂)', '(x₁−x₂, y₁−y₂)', '(x₁x₂, y₁y₂)', 'A', 'The midpoint is the average of the coordinates.', 9),
