  ('jee-adv-math-coordinate-geometry-q12', 'jee-adv-math-coordinate-geometry', 'The radical axis of two circles is:', 'The locus of equal tangent lengths (a line)', 'A circle', 'A parabola', 'A point', 'A', 'The radical axis is the straight line of points with equal tangent lengths to both circles.', 11),
