  ('jee-adv-math-area-under-curves-q03', 'jee-adv-math-area-under-curves', 'The value of ∫ from 0 to 1 of x² dx is:', '1/3', '1', '1/2', '2/3', 'A', '∫₀¹ x² dx = [x³/3]₀¹ = 1/3.', 2),
