  ('neet-physics-atoms-q05', 'neet-physics-atoms', 'The Balmer series of hydrogen lies in which region?', 'Visible', 'Ultraviolet', 'Infrared', 'X-ray', 'A', 'The Balmer series (transitions to n=2) falls in the visible region.', 4),
