  ('ssc-cgl-general-awareness-static-gk-q03', 'ssc-cgl-general-awareness-static-gk', 'The national flower of India is the:', 'Lotus', 'Rose', 'Marigold', 'Sunflower', 'A', 'The Lotus is India''s national flower.', 2),
