  ('ssc-cgl-general-awareness-sports-q03', 'ssc-cgl-general-awareness-sports', 'The term ''love'' (meaning zero) is used in:', 'Tennis', 'Cricket', 'Hockey', 'Chess', 'A', 'In tennis scoring, ''love'' means a score of zero.', 2),
