  ('gate-core-cs-theory-of-computation-q15', 'gate-core-cs-theory-of-computation', 'The pumping lemma is used to prove a language is:', 'Not regular (or not context-free)', 'Regular', 'Finite', 'Decidable', 'A', 'The pumping lemma proves non-regularity (or non-context-freeness).', 14),
