  ('gate-core-cs-computer-organization-architecture-q15', 'gate-core-cs-computer-organization-architecture', 'A cache ''hit ratio'' is the fraction of accesses:', 'Found in the cache', 'That miss', 'Written to disk', 'To registers', 'A', 'The hit ratio is the proportion of memory accesses served by the cache.', 14),
