  ('gate-engineering-mathematics-probability-q16', 'gate-engineering-mathematics-probability', 'The probability of getting at least one head in two fair coin tosses is:', '3/4', '1/2', '1/4', '1', 'A', 'P(at least one head) = 1 − P(no heads) = 1 − 1/4 = 3/4.', 15),
