  ('gate-engineering-mathematics-calculus-q14', 'gate-engineering-mathematics-calculus', 'The value of ∫ 1/x dx is:', 'ln|x| + C', 'x²/2 + C', '−1/x² + C', '1/x + C', 'A', 'The integral of 1/x is ln|x| + C.', 13),
