  ('gate-general-aptitude-data-interpretation-q14', 'gate-general-aptitude-data-interpretation', 'If sales rose from 200 to 260, the percentage growth is:', '30%', '26%', '60%', '13%', 'A', 'Growth = 60/200 × 100 = 30%.', 13),
