  ('cfa2-fixed-income-securitization-q01', 'cfa2-fixed-income-securitization', 'Securitization involves pooling assets and issuing securities backed by their:', 'Cash flows', 'Management team', 'Trademarks', 'Employees', 'A', 'Securitized bonds are backed by the cash flows of the pooled financial assets.', 0),
