  ('cfa2-fixed-income-securitization-q03', 'cfa2-fixed-income-securitization', 'The order in which cash flows are distributed to tranches is the:', 'Waterfall', 'Yield curve', 'Coupon ladder', 'Duration gap', 'A', 'The waterfall structure directs cash flows by tranche priority.', 2),
  ('cfa2-fixed-income-securitization-q04', 'cfa2-fixed-income-securitization', 'Subordination provides senior tranches with:', 'Credit enhancement', 'Higher yield', 'Prepayment protection only', 'Tax exemption', 'A', 'Junior tranches absorb losses first, giving senior tranches credit enhancement.', 3),
  ('cfa2-fixed-income-securitization-q05', 'cfa2-fixed-income-securitization', 'A mortgage pass-through security distributes pooled cash flows:', 'Pro rata to investors', 'Only to the originator', 'As a lump sum at maturity', 'To the SPE''s equity', 'A', 'Pass-throughs pass principal and interest pro rata to security holders.', 4),
  ('cfa2-fixed-income-securitization-q06', 'cfa2-fixed-income-securitization', 'CMOs primarily redistribute which risk across tranches?', 'Prepayment risk', 'Currency risk', 'Equity risk', 'Operational risk', 'A', 'Collateralized mortgage obligations carve prepayment risk into different tranches.', 5),
  ('cfa2-fixed-income-securitization-q07', 'cfa2-fixed-income-securitization', 'A benefit of securitization to the originator is:', 'Lower funding cost and risk transfer', 'Higher tax', 'Loss of all liquidity', 'Guaranteed profit', 'A', 'Securitization can lower funding costs and move risk off the balance sheet.', 6),
  ('cfa2-fixed-income-securitization-q08', 'cfa2-fixed-income-securitization', 'Contraction risk in an MBS refers to:', 'Faster prepayment when rates fall', 'Slower prepayment when rates rise', 'Default of the SPE', 'Currency depreciation', 'A', 'When rates fall, borrowers refinance faster, shortening the security''s life (contraction).', 7),
