  ('frm-financial-markets-futures-forwards-hedging-q15', 'frm-financial-markets-futures-forwards-hedging', 'A long hedge is used to protect against a:', 'Rising price of a future purchase', 'Falling price of a holding', 'Currency appreciation only', 'Coupon cut', 'A', 'A long hedge (buying futures) locks in the cost of a future purchase.', 14),
