  ('frm-valuation-risk-models-value-at-risk-q14', 'frm-valuation-risk-models-value-at-risk', 'A key weakness of VaR is that it says nothing about:', 'The size of losses beyond the threshold', 'The confidence level', 'The holding period', 'The mean return', 'A', 'VaR gives a threshold but not the magnitude of losses in the tail.', 13),
