  ('frm-quantitative-analysis-time-series-q15', 'frm-quantitative-analysis-time-series', 'A unit root in a time series indicates:', 'Non-stationarity', 'Stationarity', 'Zero mean', 'No autocorrelation', 'A', 'A unit root (e.g., a random walk) means the series is non-stationary.', 14),
