  ('frm-liquidity-risk-stress-testing-q12', 'frm-liquidity-risk-stress-testing', 'Combined (idiosyncratic plus market-wide) scenarios are used because:', 'A firm may face its own and systemic stress simultaneously', 'Only firm stress matters', 'Only market stress matters', 'Stress never combines', 'A', 'Severe events often pair a firm-specific shock with market-wide turmoil, so both are tested together.', 11),
