  ('frm-investment-risk-portfolio-risk-budgeting-q11', 'frm-investment-risk-portfolio-risk-budgeting', 'Component VaR sums across positions to equal the:', 'Total portfolio VaR', 'Sum of standalone VaRs', 'Mean return', 'Tracking error', 'A', 'Component VaR decomposes total VaR into additive contributions, unlike standalone VaRs which ignore diversification.', 10),
