  ('frm-investment-risk-factor-models-q09', 'frm-investment-risk-factor-models', 'A multifactor model explains returns using:', 'Multiple systematic risk factors', 'Only the market factor', 'No factors', 'Idiosyncratic risk only', 'A', 'Multifactor models (e.g., Fama-French) attribute returns to several systematic factors beyond the market.', 8),
